# Generated build output, at any level. The repo-root form matters: a build
# once wrote a repo-root output/ tree containing a generated challenges/config.php
# with live database credentials, and only math_tutor/output/ was ignored at the
# time, so it was committed. config.php is generated by challenge_config.py from
# environment values and must never be tracked.
output/
math_tutor/output/
math_tutor/.vscode/sftp.json
.vscode/sftp.json
